WEBVTT

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:01.256
ndani ya paa la mdomo wako,

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:02.816
unatakiwa kuzipata zote.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:05.576
Hivyo Ed angefanya hivi

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:08.096
na ange --

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:10.816
uso wake ungewaka na angesema,

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:14.816
"Kahawa hii ina ladha ya tufaa ya
honey-crisp

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:18.376
na ladha za udongo na sukari ya maple."

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:21.016
Na ningekunywa kidogo na kusema,

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:23.776
"Napata ladha ya kahawa.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.616
(Kicheko)

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:27.496
Kwangu ina ladha kama kahawa."

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.536
(Kicheko)

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:32.496
Lakini kwa msukumo wa Ed, nikaamua
kabisa